    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ENTER THE ARENA </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Fireball unites the best of the heart-pounding world of sports with the show-stopping power of magic to create a lawless footbrawl-like battle arena game. A roster of first-class heroes are dying to unleash their ultimate superpowers to help you crush your opponents! Let none stand in your way to the top, but watch out\u2014there is no mercy in the arena. Anything goes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/925ee25b7779ca084e86d873256bb689.poster.avif?t=1749833919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/925ee25b7779ca084e86d873256bb689.webm?t=1749833919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/925ee25b7779ca084e86d873256bb689.mp4?t=1749833919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 V 2 REAL-TIME BATTLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you and your team have what it takes to become Project Fireball champions? All you need to do is fight tooth and nail through the other team\u2019s defenses (no sweat) to score goals in their net (nothing to it). Use any means necessary\u2014the environment, your super abilities, and your skills\u2014 and remember: the best defense is an aggressive offense. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/7a814fcad566e7f89278a72ff37f0e77.poster.avif?t=1749833919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/7a814fcad566e7f89278a72ff37f0e77.webm?t=1749833919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/7a814fcad566e7f89278a72ff37f0e77.mp4?t=1749833919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUTURISTIC FANTASY ARCADE FOOTBRAWL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the event of the century in a futuristic open-air arena with the most heroic of heroes, each with their own twisted super abilities. Transform the ball into an unstoppable charge of energy and score. This is the height of entertainment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/964a47345c6f9be42183d09089ddf14f.poster.avif?t=1749833919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/964a47345c6f9be42183d09089ddf14f.webm?t=1749833919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/964a47345c6f9be42183d09089ddf14f.mp4?t=1749833919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUN AND SERIOUS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All champions have to start somewhere, so don\u2019t take it too hard when you\u2019re obliterated by your opponents. Get back up and start strategizing with your teammates. Whether you\u2019re looking to master the world of Project Fireball or are a curious casual who just wants to pull off some wild stunts, you\u2019re in the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/c0869861516514e8df11cd2d338bd395.poster.avif?t=1749833919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/c0869861516514e8df11cd2d338bd395.webm?t=1749833919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/c0869861516514e8df11cd2d338bd395.mp4?t=1749833919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BORN IN FRANCE, RAISED WORLDWIDE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Fireball is brought to you by the brilliant minds of a small but mighty international group in France who can\u2019t wait to see everyone duking it out in the arena in a display of guts and glory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep in touch by joining Project Fireball\u2019s official Discord, and &quot;wishlist&quot; and &quot;follow&quot; on Steam for all the hottest news.</p>",
