eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/c0869861516514e8df11cd2d338bd395.poster.avif?t=1749833919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/c0869861516514e8df11cd2d338bd395.webm?t=1749833919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449280/extras/c0869861516514e8df11cd2d338bd395.mp4?t=1749833919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BORN IN FRANCE, RAISED WORLDWIDE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Fireball is brought to you by the brilliant minds of a small but mighty international group in France who can\u2019t wait to see everyone duking it out in the arena in a display of guts and glory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep in touch by joining Project Fireball\u2019s official Discord, and &quot;wishlist&quot; and &quot;follow&quot; on Steam for all the hottest news.</p>",
    "short_description": "Let\u2019s get ready to rumble! Take to the arena in the one and only Project Fireball, a rowdy fantasy-arcade footbrawl game where there are no rules. Choose your hero and use their super abilities to show everyone who\u2019s boss in epic 2v2 matches.",
